issue
tab next pane        ↓/j    down         d/ctrl+d  half page down        1-9          saved query        ...
e   edit fields      ↑/k    up           u/ctrl+u  half page up          g            where to go
t   change status    f/pgdn page down    g g       top                   g 1-9        switch view
C   comment          b/pgup page up      G / g e   bottom                ctrl+, / g s settings
                     →/l    pan right    shift+tab previous pane         g i          jump to an issue
                     ←/h    pan left     z         expand or collapse    esc          back
                                         <         wider sidebar         r            refresh
                                         >         wider description     R            refetch everything
                                         =         reset the split

